# 🎯 Huddle

**Huddle** is an all-in-one social platform — chat, watch videos together, play games, and make voice/video calls, all in one place.

### 🌐 [**Click here to open the live app**](https://huddle-frontend-n9z2.onrender.com)

> ⚠️ The backend is hosted on Render's free tier — if it's been inactive, the first request can take **up to 50 seconds** to wake up. Please be patient on first load.

---

## ✨ Features

- **Landing Page** — marketing-style intro page for new visitors
- **Authentication** — signup/login with Firebase (email + password), each user gets a unique `@username` (Huddle ID)
- **Dashboard** — central hub with cards for every feature
- **Friends System** — connect with anyone using their Huddle ID (like adding on Instagram), view their profile and thoughts
- **Personal Chat** — WhatsApp-style 1-on-1 messaging with:
  - Text, images, videos, and documents
  - Voice calls
  - Video calls with screen share
- **Group Rooms** — create a room and share the code with friends/family:
  - Real-time Chat Room
  - Watch Party (YouTube videos synced for everyone)
  - Video/Voice Call with screen share
- **Games** — playable solo (vs. computer / pass-and-play) or online with friends via a room code:
  - Tic Tac Toe (with unbeatable minimax AI in solo mode)
  - Snake
  - Ludo (with a computer-controlled 3-player mode)
- **Profile** — edit name, phone, profile picture, and post "Thoughts" (status updates) visible to friends
- **Mobile Responsive** — works on phones and tablets

