## 🚀 Running Locally

### 1. Clone the repo

```bash
git clone https://github.com/Ajadbharti/Huddle-.git
cd Huddle-
```

### 2. Set up the backend

```bash
cd server
npm install
node index.js
```

### 3. Set up the frontend

```bash
cd ../client
npm install
```

Create a `.env` file inside `client/`:
```
VITE_SERVER_URL=http://localhost:3000
```

Run it:
```bash
npm run dev
```

Visit `http://localhost:5173`.

